# Calling mockmachina wrongly fails with a message on stderr, as Fang shows it
# to users. TestRun checks the exit code is 2; testscript can only tell zero
# from non-zero.
! exec mockmachina --nope
! stdout .
stderr 'Unknown flag: --nope\.'

! exec mockmachina nope
! stdout .
stderr 'Unknown command "nope" for "mockmachina"\.'
